        "introduction": "This is a step by step replacement guide for the bridge of an acoustic guitar. Replacing the bridge on a guitar may be necessary if the bridge is damaged or falling off. This is a fairly simple task and can be accomplished very easily by following this simple 10 step guide. No prior guitar repair experience or special tools are needed to accomplish this task. Just be careful, follow the steps, and it should turn out great!",
